    <skos:broader rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/ad4gd/ev/ebv/Primary_productivity"/>
    <skos:definition>Productivity in an ecosystem refers to the percentage of energy that enters the ecosystem in the form of biomass at a particular trophic level. It is the rate at which biomass is formed in EU freshwater ecosystems and transitional waters.</skos:definition>
